{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Drizzle",
    "steam_appid": 3643000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/497a139619ef84049f4323f9da865163.avif?t=1753029634\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/772ad7d772eb0380d05e3ad30ed10128.poster.avif?t=1753029634\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/772ad7d772eb0380d05e3ad30ed10128.webm?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/772ad7d772eb0380d05e3ad30ed10128.mp4?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on your grandfrog's fishing boat and venture forth into an oceanic paradise rife with magic and teeming with aquatic life. Cast your line in over 5 unique regions as you uncover the mystery of the ocean's ultimate prize: The Jewel of the Sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/534391bfec990979978b6696b50d377b.avif?t=1753029634\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/45c18db7a823128b4b8427d3eda8259b.poster.avif?t=1753029634\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/45c18db7a823128b4b8427d3eda8259b.webm?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/45c18db7a823128b4b8427d3eda8259b.mp4?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean back and enjoy a relaxing fishing experience, where you can catch over 100 unique fish and populate your fishing journal. And even if you don't quite catch something with fins and gills, almost everything has a use, so keep your chin up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c3aa8882f3b0d320270f8f02a95d123f.avif?t=1753029634\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c95945011cce45ac5241012897071b5e.poster.avif?t=1753029634\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c95945011cce45ac5241012897071b5e.webm?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c95945011cce45ac5241012897071b5e.mp4?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and befriend a diverse cast of adorable froggy fellows, all with their own unique stories and goals. Listen to their woes and help them out, and they just might help you back. Finding the Jewel of the Sea is no easy task, but with friends by your side you've got nothing to fear!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/497a139619ef84049f4323f9da865163.avif?t=1753029634\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/772ad7d772eb0380d05e3ad30ed10128.poster.avif?t=1753029634\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/772ad7d772eb0380d05e3ad30ed10128.webm?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/772ad7d772eb0380d05e3ad30ed10128.mp4?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on your grandfrog's fishing boat and venture forth into an oceanic paradise rife with magic and teeming with aquatic life. Cast your line in over 5 unique regions as you uncover the mystery of the ocean's ultimate prize: The Jewel of the Sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/534391bfec990979978b6696b50d377b.avif?t=1753029634\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/45c18db7a823128b4b8427d3eda8259b.poster.avif?t=1753029634\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/45c18db7a823128b4b8427d3eda8259b.webm?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/45c18db7a823128b4b8427d3eda8259b.mp4?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean back and enjoy a relaxing fishing experience, where you can catch over 100 unique fish and populate your fishing journal. And even if you don't quite catch something with fins and gills, almost everything has a use, so keep your chin up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c3aa8882f3b0d320270f8f02a95d123f.avif?t=1753029634\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c95945011cce45ac5241012897071b5e.poster.avif?t=1753029634\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c95945011cce45ac5241012897071b5e.webm?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643000/extras/c95945011cce45ac5241012897071b5e.mp4?t=1753029634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and befriend a diverse cast of adorable froggy fellows, all with their own unique stories and goals. Listen to their woes and help them out, and they just might help you back. Finding the Jewel of the Sea is no easy task, but with friends by your side you've got nothing to fear!</p>",
    "short_description": "In Drizzle, drift off on a cozy journey to fulfill an old frog's wish. Reel in a host of unique fish in a variety of inspiring aquatic locales, help out and befriend an adorable cast of froggy friends, and maybe, just maybe... find something incredible.",
